 <9, p. 9>

suvakṣa sumūrti sumaddha yaśovata ādityaprabhāva prabhaviṣṇuḥ someśvara soma 
saumya anantadho lokaśrī magana gaganāḍhya gaganamaṃ kṣiteśvā maheśvara 
kṣitikṣitigarbha nīvaraṇa sarvāvaraṇa sarvāvaraṇa viṣkambhi sarvanīvaraṇaviṣkambhi 
samantanirmathanaḥ samantabhadraḥ bhadrapāṇiḥ sudhanaḥ susaṃhataḥ rasupuṣya 
sunabha ākāśa ākāśagarbhaḥ savārthagarbhaḥ sarvodbhava anivartī anivartita 
apāyajaha avivartita avaivarttikasarvadharmopaśceti | etaiścānyaiśca 
bodhisattvairmahāsattvaiḥ sārdhaṃ bhagavān śākyamuniḥ śuddhāvāsabhavane 
viharati sma ||

anyairapi bodhisattvairmahāsattvaiḥ strīrūpadhāribhiḥ 
anantacaryārthalokanirahārasakalasattvāśaya 
anivartanamārgapratiṣṭhāpanatayācintyāvidyāpadamantradhāraṇī 
oṣadhaveṣarūpadhāribhirnānāvidhapakṣigaṇayakṣarākṣasamaṇimantraratnarājasattva 
asattvasaṅkhyānasamanupraveśasattvacaryānuvartibhiryathāsayasattvavinayanathānu(-)
kāribhiḥ 
tatprativiśiṣṭarūpānuvartibhirvidyārājopadeśayathāvabodhadharmaniryātatathāgatā(-)
bjakuliśasarvalaukikalokottarasamanupraveśasamayānatikramaṇīyavacanapathapratiṣṭhā(-)
panatṛratnavaṃśānupacchedakartṛbhiḥ tadyathā (-) 

