 <10, p. 10>

tathāgatapātra dharmacakra tathāgataśayana tathāgatāvabhāsa tathāgatavacana 
tathāgatoṣṭha tathāgatoru tathāgatānnala tathāgatadhvaja (******?) tathāgatacihnaśceti | 
