parṇāsavarijāṅgu(******?)nasīpramukhairanantanirhāradharmadhātugaganasvabhāvaiḥ 

 <11, p. 11>

sattvacaryāvikurvi(******?)ṣṭhānasañjanitamānasaiḥ dūtadūtī (**?)peṭī 
kiṅkarakiṅkarī yakṣayakṣī rākṣasarākṣasīṃ piśācapiśācī 
abjakulasamayānupraveśamantravicāribhiḥ yena taṃ śuddhāvāsaṃ devabhavanaṃ 
