pūjākarmaṇodyuktamānaso abhūvaṃsthitavantaḥ ||

tasmin bhagavataḥ śākyamuneḥ samīpaṃ vajrapāṇiḥ bodhisattvaḥ svakaṃ 
vidyāgaṇamāmantrayate sma | sannipātaṃ ha bhavanto'smadvidyāgaṇaparivṛtāḥ 
sakrodharājaḥ vidyārājarājñibhirmahādūtibhiḥ smaraṇamātreṇaiva sarvā 
vidyāgaṇāḥ sannipatitāḥ | tadyathā (-) 

