gandhanāntaścara mahākrodhāntaścara maheśvarāntaścara sarvavidyāntaścara ghoraḥ 
sughoraḥ kṣepa upakṣepaḥ padanikṣepaḥ vināyakāntakṣepaḥ savinyāsakṣepaḥ 
utkṛṣṭakṣepa bala mahābala sumbha bhramara bhṛṅgiriṭi krodha mahākrodha sarvakrodha 
ajara ajagara jvara śoṣa nāgānta daṇḍa nīladaṇḍa aṅgada raktāṅga vajradaṇḍa medhya 
mahāmedhya kāla kālakūṭa śvitraroma sarvabhūtasaṃkṣaya śūla mahāśūla arti 
