pramathana grasana saṃsāra araha yugāntārka prāṇahara śakraghna dveṣa āmarṣa 
kuṇḍali sukuṇḍali amṛtakuṇḍali anantakuṇḍali ratnakuṇḍali bāhu mahābāhu 
mahāroga duṣṭasarpa vasarpa kuṣṭha upadrava bhakṣaka atṛpta ucchuṣyaśceti | 
