sādhanīyamiti ||

atha sā sarvāvatī parṣat sabuddhabodhisattvapratyekabuddhāryaśrāvakādhiṣṭhitā evaṃ 
vācamudīrayantaḥ sādhu sādhu bho jinaputra (!) vicitra 
(***?)caryārthakriyādharmanayapraveśānuvartinī dharmadeśanāsudeśitā 
sarvasattvā(******?)rthāya aho kumārabhūta (!) mañjuśrīḥ (!) 
vicitradahrmadeśanānuvartinī mantracaryānukūlā subhāṣitā | yo hi kaścit 
mahārājñaḥ imaṃ sannipātaparivartaṃ vācayiṣyati dhārayiṣyati manasi kariṣyasi 
saṅgrāme vāgrataḥ hastimāropya sthāpayiṣyati vividhairvā 
puṣpadhūpagandhavilepanaiḥ pūjayiṣyati pratyarthikānāṃ pratyamitrāṇāṃ 
