svagṛhe sthāpayiṣyati tasya kulaputrasya vā kuladuhiturvā mahārājñasya vā 
mahārājñīyaṃ vā bhikṣurvā bhikṣaṇyā vā upāsikasya vā upāsikāyā vā 
mahārakṣāṃ mahābhogatāṃ dīrghāyuṣmatāṃ āyurārogyatāṃ 
satatabhogābhivardhanatāṃ kariṣyāmīti ||

evamuktastu sā sarvāvatī parṣat tūṣṇīmabhūt ||

[mahāyānamantracaryānirdeśyamahākalpāt 
mañjuśrīkumārabhūtabodhisattvavikurvaṇapaṭalavisarāt mūlakalpāt prathamaḥ 
sannipātaparivartaḥ] ||
 <25, p. 25>

[atha dvitīyaḥ parivartaḥ] |

atha khalu mañjuśrīḥ kumārabhūtaḥ sarvāvantaṃ parṣanmaṇḍalamavalokya 
sarvasattvamayānupraveśāvalokinīṃ nāma samādhiṃ samāpadyate | sma | 
samanantarasamāpannasya ca mañjuśriyaḥ kumārabhūtasya nābhimaṇḍalapradeśād 
raśmirniścaranti sma | anekaraśmikoṭīniyutaśatasahasraparivāritā samantāt 
sarvasatvadhātumavabhāsya punareva taṃ śuddhāvāsabhavanaṃ avabhāsya sthitābhūt 
||

atha khalu vajrapāṇirbodhisatvo mahāsatvaḥ mañjuśriyaṃ kumārabhūtamāmantrayate 
sma | bhāṣa bhāṣa tvaṃ bho jinaputra (!) sarvasatvasamayānupraveśanaṃ nāma 
samanupraviśya tvadīyaṃ mantragaṇaṃ sarvalaukikalokottaraṃ ca mantrasiddhiṃ 
samanuprāpnuvanti | evamukta āguhyakādhipatinā yakṣendreṇa mañjuśrīḥ 
kumārabhūtaḥ paramaguhyamaṇḍalatantraṃ bhāṣate sma | sarvavidyasañcodanaṃ 
nāma sa (** ?) vikurvaṇaṃ vidantayati | dakṣiṇaṃ ca pāṇimudyamya aṅgulyāgreṇa 
parṣanmaṇḍalamākārayati sma | tasminnaṅgulyagre 
anekavidyārājakoṭīnayutaśatasahasrāṇi niśceruḥ | niścaritvā ca sarvāvantaṃ 
śuddhāvāsabhavanaṃ mahatāvabhāsenāvabhāsya ca sthitvā abhūvam ||

atha mañjuśrīḥ kumārabhūtaḥ yamāntakasya krodharājasya hṛdayaṃ sarvakarmikaṃ 
ekavīraṃ āvāhanavisarjanaśāntikapauṣṭika ābhicāruka 
