prapadyate tathā tathā sādhyamānaḥ akṣaraṃ nāma mahāvīryaṃ sarvārthasādhanaṃ 
mahākrodharājam | katamaṃ ca tat | oṃ | āḥ | hrūṁ | idaṃ tanmahākrodhasya hṛdayam | 
sarvakarmikaṃ sarvamaṇḍaleṣu sarvamantracaryāsu ca nirdiṣṭaṃ mahāsattvena 
(***?)yoṣeṇa sarvavighnavināśanam ||

(** ?) mañjuśrīḥ kumārabhūtaḥ dakṣiṇaṃ (**** ?) mya krodhasya mūrdhni 
